+# Effectopus
+
+Motion graphics and visual effects compositor: layers with keyframes and a graph editor, masks and shapes, text animators, expressions, 3D cameras and lights, over 300 effects and a render queue, with GPU compositing. Part of RNG Studio by RNG Media S.L. — https://www.rng.media/effectopus
+
+Effectopus is based on EffectCraft by the ArtCraft team, modified by RNG Media S.L. It is not made or endorsed by the ArtCraft team. Licence: MIT OR Apache-2.0 (`LICENSE-MIT`, `LICENSE-APACHE`, `NOTICE`); changes are listed in `MODIFICATIONS.md`. The Effectopus name and icon belong to RNG Media S.L.
+
+Build: `cargo build --release -p effectcraft` (binary `target/release/effectcraft`).
